meta {
  name: Record Payment
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/pay-later/{{payLaterId}}/record-payment
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "amount": 100.00
  }
}

docs {
  # Record Pay Later Payment

  Records a payment against a pay-later (credit) record.

  ## Path Parameters

  | Parameter | Type | Description |
  |-----------|------|-------------|
  | payLaterId | GUID | The pay-later record ID |

  ## Request Body

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  |-------|------|----------|-------------|
  | amount | decimal | Yes | Payment amount |

  ## Behavior

  1. Adds `amount` to `paidAmount`
  2. If `paidAmount >= payLaterAmount`, sets `isCompleted = true`
  3. Updates `lastModifiedUtc`

  ## Response

  Returns the updated pay-later record.

  ```json
  {
    "id": "guid",
    "paidAmount": 300.00,
    "remainingAmount": 200.00,
    "isCompleted": false
  }
  ```

  ## Authorization

  Requires `sales.complete` capability (Cashier, Manager, Admin).
}
